    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108590" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποκόλαμμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>the fold-over</i> of a garment, <i>subsumen, subsutio,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gloss.
			</span></i>: written <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποκᾴλαμμα</span> in <i><span class="en">
				<u>PMag.Osl.</u>
				1.40
			</span></i>, and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποκάλυμμα</span> in <i><span class="en">
				<u>PMag.Lond.</u>
				121.190
			</span></i>: cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνακολαφή</span> and
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνακολαφίς</span>
			(<span class="entity">Addenda</span>).</div>
